                "width": 48,
                "height": 5,
                "widget": {
                    "title": "",
                    "text": {
                        "content": "## \ud83d\udcca Anthropic Model Usage Dashboard  `[v3.3-final \u2022 Complete Edition]`\nExecutive landing page: 24h volume & ratio scorecards, proportional Donut shares, Dual-Axis Volume vs Error overlay, and Per-Model Leaderboard Table.\n\n**Suite Navigation:** **[00 Usage Summary]** | 01 Fable 5 Deep-Dive | 02 Fleet Overview | 03 Latency & SLOs | 04 Errors & Reliability | 05 Caching & FinOps | 06 Capacity & Quota  \n*Features: Multi-Dimensional Interactive Filters \u2022 Ratio Scorecards \u2022 Donut Shares \u2022 Dual-Axis Correlation \u2022 Live Data Tables \u2022 SRE/FinOps Playbooks*",
                        "format": "MARKDOWN",
                        "style": {
                            "backgroundColor": "#1A1A2E",
                            "textColor": "#E0E0E0",
                            "fontSize": "FS_MEDIUM",
                            "padding": "P_MEDIUM",
                            "horizontalAlignment": "H_LEFT",
                            "verticalAlignment": "V_CENTER"
                        }
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "xPos": 0,
                "yPos": 5,
                "width": 48,
                "height": 4,
                "widget": {
                    "title": "\ud83d\udd11 Executive 24h Key Metrics & Ratios",
                    "sectionHeader": {
                        "subtitle": "Volume scorecards paired with normalized Tokens/Request and Error Rate ratios",
                        "dividerBelow": true
                    }
                }
            },
            {
                "xPos": 0,
                "yPos": 9,
                "width": 8,
                "height": 12,
                "widget": {
                    "title": "Total tokens (24h)",
                    "scorecard": {
                        "timeSeriesQuery": {
                            "timeSeriesFilter": {
                                "filter": "metric.type=\"aiplatform.googleapis.com/publisher/online_serving/token_count\" resource.type=\"aiplatform.googleapis.com/PublisherModel\" resource.label.\"publisher\"=\"anthropic\"",
                                "aggregation": {
                                    "alignmentPeriod": "86400s",
                                    "perSeriesAligner": "ALIGN_SUM",
                                    "crossSeriesReducer": "REDUCE_SUM"
                                }
                            }
                        },
                        "sparkChartView": {
                            "sparkChartType": "SPARK_LINE"
                        },
                        "thresholds": [
                            {
                                "value": 50000000,
                                "color": "YELLOW",
                                "direction": "ABOVE",
                                "label": "High"
                            },
                            {
                                "value": 100000000,
                                "color": "RED",
                                "direction": "ABOVE",
                                "label": "Very high"
                            }
